tion and his experiences. What might lead an Ethiopian schoolgirl to eat a wall of her house, piece by piece, or a pair of brothers to die beneath an avalanche of household junk that they had compulsively hoarded? At what point does a harmless idea, a snowflake in a clear summer sky, become a blinding blizzard of unwanted thoughts? Drawing on the latest research on the brain, as well as historical accounts of patients and their treatments, this is a book that will challenge the way you think about what is normal and what is mental illness.","publicationYear":2015,"subjectCategories":[{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Obsessive-compulsive disorder","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-the-man-who-couldn-t-stop-david-adam"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Anecdotes","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-the-man-who-couldn-t-stop-david-adam"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"nyt:health=2015-02-08","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-the-man-who-couldn-t-stop-david-adam"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"New York Times bestseller","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-the-man-who-couldn-t-stop-david-adam"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"New York Times reviewed","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-the-man-who-couldn-t-stop-david-adam"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Great britain, biography","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-the-man-who-couldn-t-stop-david-adam"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Personal memoirs","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-the-man-who-couldn-t-stop-david-adam"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Psychology","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-the-man-who-couldn-t-stop-david-adam"}],"displaySummary":"In this captivating fusion of science, history, and perso